---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../site";

const metadata = {
	title: SITE.sections.about.title,
	description: SITE.sections.about.description,
	canonicalURL: "/about/",
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
	<h1>About</h1>
	<section class="prose">
		<p>
			As a Design Engineer with roots in both UI design and front-end development, I bridge the gap between
			human needs and technical implementation. My work focuses on creating accessible, performant, and
			delightful digital experiences that respect both the people who use them and the systems that power
			them.
		</p>

		<p>
			I see technology and design not as separate disciplines but as complementary forces that expand human
			potential. Where technology creates new possibilities, design makes those possibilities meaningful and
			accessible to everyone.
		</p>

		<p>
			Throughout my career, I've developed a systems-thinking approach that values both elegant code
			architecture and thoughtful user experiences. I believe that truly excellent products emerge when design
			decisions are informed by technical understanding and technical choices are guided by human-centered
			design principles.
		</p>

		<p>
			My expertise spans design systems, component architecture, accessibility implementation, and front-end
			performance - always with an eye toward creating tools and experiences that contribute to our collective
			intelligence and capability.
		</p>
	</section>
</Layout>
